			<note>The two new cases at whist added as the final leaf of </note>
			<note url="games.3.xml">Games.3</note>
			<note>, the "twelfth" edition, are moved to chapter XVII "New Cases at Whist never publish'd 'till
			1760" where they appear as cases II and III. Case IV is the last new material to be added by
			Hoyle, "A Case of Curiosity, first publish'd 1763." </note>
